  "label": "Boxing as Metaphor for Power Hierarchy",
  "description": "The visual of boxing, with one fighter dominating the other, is used metaphorically to represent racial hierarchy and violence. The aggressor (boxer_1) symbolizes the dominant power structure, while the recipient of the punch (boxer_2) symbolizes the oppressed group. This metaphor is central to understanding the meme's hateful intent.",
